(1) LENGTH-GAUGE WEIGHT MAP  (g_lambda: l -> mu*l)
==============================================================================
   weight(X) := log[ X(mu*l) / X(l) ] / log(mu)   (degree / homogeneity map)

   sympy-exact degree-map residuals  (must be identically 0):
     weight(A_rec = l^2       ) =    2   expected   2   residual 0
     weight(sigma_A = 1/l^2   ) =   -2   expected  -2   residual 0
     weight(G = l^2           ) =    2   expected   2   residual 0
     weight(l_step = l        ) =    1   expected   1   residual 0
     weight(1/l               ) =   -1   expected  -1   residual 0
     weight(pure count        ) =    0   expected   0   residual 0
   all weight residuals identically zero (sympy): True

   BIJECTION  G(l) = (1/4)/sigma_A(l)   ->   G*sigma_A is l-independent:
     G*sigma_A (exact)        = 1/4     (expected 1/4)
     weight(G*sigma_A)        = 0      (expected 0)
     residual value (-1/4)    = 0
     residual weight (-0)     = 0

